## Quick Start

```csharp
// Attach {{ s.name }}Player + {{ s.name }}Trigger to the NPC GameObject.
// Subscribe to events:
var player = npcObject.GetComponent<{{ s.name }}Player>();
player.OnLine    += (speaker, text, emotion, id) => subtitleUI.Show(speaker, text);
player.OnLineEnd += (id) => Debug.Log("Finished: " + id);
player.OnDialogEnd += () => Debug.Log("Dialog complete");

// Start dialog manually:
player.StartDialog();
```

